Hello, friends! We are happy to say that we have fixed some issues that have been bugging players for a while now, these include:

-Missing achievements of total amount of found cats;
-Invisible cats on the main level;
-Main level building segment not colored even with completed game;
-Being unable to click on remaining people on the main level;
-Game occupying 2 GB of space;
-Not receiving No Hint on Normal mode achievement when completing main level without hint.

You may now return to enjoying the game as it was intended, happy finding!!
